# Exception: the slim catalog shipped inside the ayiru-mcp wheel is the
# whole point of that package. Built by tools/scripts/build_slim_catalog.py
# and committed so a clean checkout produces a functional wheel.
!mcp/ayiru_mcp/data/catalog.db
# Exception: the multi-family bulk catalog is the actual product. It is too
# large and too non-deterministic to rebuild from a clean clone (it depends
# on a live docs crawl), so a frozen snapshot is committed via Git LFS — see
# .gitattributes and `make catalog-snapshot`.
!backend/ayiru_v0.2_bulk.db

